[h1]About new game mode[/h1]

[b]"Arena"[/b]
In the "Arena" game mode you have to defend yourself from demons. In the start you have only a knife. In order to fight back - you need to look for loot: weapons, ammunition, medkits. The player in this mode, compared with the "Story" and "Hardcore", has improved parameters: more health and stamina, faster running, extended radius selection of objects.


At the beginning of the game you have 0 points. Every 10 seconds is awarded 10 points. Points are also awarded for killed monsters. When you reach a certain number of points the game becomes more difficult.
 
